Package: metaprep
Type: Package
Title: Tidy Preparation of Dependent Effect Estimates for Meta-Analysis
Version: 0.3.1
Authors@R: c(person(
      given = "Alex",
      family = "Coppock",
      email = "acoppock@gmail.com",
      role = c("aut", "cre")))
Description: A tidy workflow for preparing dependent effect estimates for
    meta-analysis. Many studies contribute several correlated estimates, for
    example multiple treatment arms compared with a shared control, and the
    estimates_vcov object keeps those estimates and their block-diagonal
    variance-covariance matrix synchronized through 'dplyr' operations. It then
    passes them to 'metafor' for multi-arm meta-analysis, including
    cluster-robust standard errors.
